## Instructions & Decision Criteria
Evaluate whether this candidate's role, headline, or search context aligns with our campaign target audience.

- **Set `qualified = true`** if their title, headline, or search query alignment indicates they are in a target role, management, executive, operations, founder, or decision-making position matching our campaign objective.
